### Page 2 of 15

```text
ORDINANCE NO. ____________________

ENTITLED: "AN ORDINANCE AMENDING THE OFFICIAL ZONING MAP OF THE CITY
OF CHEYENNE CHANGING THE ZONING CLASSIFICATION FROM
COUNTY A-1 AGRICULTURAL AND RURAL RESIDENTIAL TO NR-3
NEIGHBORHOOD RESIDENTIAL – HIGH DENSITY FOR LAND LOCATED
SOUTHWEST OF THE INTERSECTION OF RIDGE ROAD AND HOLLAND
COURT."

BE IT ORDAINED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE CITY OF CHEYENNE,
WYOMING:

Section 1. That the owner(s) of the property described herein has (have) applied for a zoning map
amendment (“zone change”) for said property in accordance with Section 2.2.1, Zoning Map Amendment,
of the Cheyenne Unified Development Code (“UDC”).

Section 2.   That on January 3, 2023, the City of Cheyenne Planning Commission conducted a
public hearing reviewing the proposed zone change that is the subject of this ordinance.

Section 3.
That the Governing Body of the City of Cheyenne finds that the zone change that is
the subject of this ordinance meets the criteria specified in Section 2.2.1.d of the UDC.

Section 4.
That, in accordance with Section 2.2.1, Zoning Map Amendment, Section 5.1.2,
Zoning Districts Established, and Section 5.1.3, Official Zoning Map, of the UDC, the aforementioned
application is hereby approved and the zoning classification of the real property described as:
a parcel of land being a portion of Tract 25, Dell Range Addition and located in the
northwest one-quarter of the northwest one-quarter of Section 22, Township 14 North,
Range 66 West of the 6th Principal Meridian; being more particularly described as:
beginning at a found aluminum cap on a point of intersection of the west line of said Section
22 and the south right of way of Holland Ct; thence along said south right of way
S89°31'21”E at a distance of 619.35 feet to a found iron pipe on the westerly right of way
line of Ridge Road; thence continuing along said westerly right of way line S00°02'45”W
at a distance of 753.31 feet to a point; thence leaving said westerly right of way line of
Ridge Road N89°23'37”W at a distance of 619.54 feet to a found iron pipe on the west line
of said Section 22; thence N00°03'36”E at a distance of 751.91 feet along the west line of
said Section 22 to the point of beginning.
is hereby changed to NR-3 Neighborhood Residential – High Density.

Section 5.  That the City Engineer is hereby authorized and directed to alter and amend the Official
Zoning Map as described in Section 5.1.3 of the UDC to comply with the zone change as described in
Section 4 above when this ordinance takes effect in accordance with Section 7 below.

Section 6. Sections, paragraphs, sentences, clauses and phrases of this ordinance are severable. If
any section, paragraph, sentence, clause, or phrase of this ordinance is declared unconstitutional, such
unconstitutionality shall not affect any of the remaining sections, paragraphs, sentences, clauses, and
phrases.

Section 7. That this ordinance shall be in full force and effect upon its approval and publication.
```

